Generate HTML from saved results without running browsers

Usage: whirl report [OPTIONS] --html <PATH> <REPORT>

Arguments:
  <REPORT>  A version 1 Whirl JSON report

Options:
      --html <PATH>              Write a standalone HTML report
      --metadata <PATH>          Replace saved author context; flow keys match recorded paths exactly
      --working-directory <DIR>  Resolve relative artifact paths here instead of the recorded directory
  -h, --help                     Print help
